trics from Facebook Ads. Grain: one row per ad_id + ad_date. Dirty string values such as 'null' are converted to real NULLs.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"cdc_marketing://models/staging/facebook/stg_facebook_ads_basic_all_levels.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models/staging/facebook/stg_facebook_ads_basic_all_levels.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_marketing_ads_stats\", \"unique_id\": \"model.cdc_marketing.int_marketing_ads_stats\", \"database_name\": \"bronze_production\", \"schema_name\": \"cdc_staging\", \"table_name\": \"int_marketing_ads_stats\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"cdc_marketing\", \"description\": \"Cross-platform daily ad performance stats. Snapchat country-level data is aggregated to ad + day so both platforms share the same grain. Grain: one row per platform + ad_id + date.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"view\", \"patch_path\": \"cdc_marketing://models/intermediate/int_marketing_ads_stats.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models/intermediate/int_marketing_ads_stats.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"fct_marketing_performance\", \"unique_id\": \"model.cdc_marketing.fct_marketing_performance\", \"database_name\": \"bronze_production\", \"schema_name\": \"cdc_staging\", \"table_name\": \"fct_marketing_performance\", \"owners\": \"[]\", \"tags\": \"[]\", \"package_name\": \"cdc_marketing\", \"description\": \"Unified marketing performance fact table. Combines Facebook and Snapchat daily ad metrics with key descriptive attributes and standard KPIs (CTR, CPC, CPM). Grain: one row per platform + ad_id + date.\\n\", \"materialization\": \"table\", \"patch_path\": \"cdc_marketing://models/marts/fct_marketing_performance.yml\", \"full_path\": \"models/marts/fct_marketing_performance.sql\", \"meta\": \"{}\"}, {\"name\": \"int_facebook_ads_details\", \"unique_id\": \"model.cdc_marketing.int_facebook_ads_details\", \"database_name\": \"bronze_production\", \"schema_name\": \"cdc_staging\", \"table_name\": \"int